  "steps": [
    "Add 1 tsp ghee to a pan and roast jeera and hing.",
    "Add onion and saute until transparent. Then add green chilli and garlic paste.",
    "Cook for 2 mins and add the tomato puree. Cover and cook until the mixture is mushy.",
    "Add garam masala, coriander powder, red chilli, salt, pepper, haldi, and aamchur and mix well.",
    "Add peas, spinach, mushrooms, boiled and squeezed soya granules and 1 cup of water.",
    "Cover and cook for atleast 7-8 mins and then add coconut milk, sugar and cinnamon powder.",
    "Cook again for 8-10 mins and add water if needed to adjust consistency.",
    "Serve with hot phulkas and enjoy."
  ],
